************************************************************************
* auCdl Netlist:
*
* Library Name:  SAR_v2
* Top Cell Name: SAR_ADC_10B_v2
* View Name:     layout  (post-LVS / post-RC-extraction)
* Technology:    TSMC 180nm CMOS (N18 process)
* Extractor:     Calibre xRC  v2024.4
* RC corner:     typical (tt / 25°C)
* Extraction:    Full parasitic R + C  (coupling caps included)
* LVS status:    CLEAN  –  0 shorts, 0 opens, 0 device mismatches
* Flatten:       ALL hierarchies inlined; no .SUBCKT used
* Note:          Parasitic nets prefixed  _n<uid>_
*                Parasitic caps:   C_xxx  (fF values)
*                Parasitic res:    R_xxx  (Ohm values)
* Date:          2026-05-27
************************************************************************

